flowchart TD
  START[Connect or transfer] --> VALID{Validation succeeds?}
  VALID -->|frame or CRC failure| REJECT[Reject frame; no partial payload applied]
  VALID -->|fragment gap or timeout| RESET[Reset affected lane]
  VALID -->|queue full| DROP[Count/drop bounded packet]
  VALID -->|yes| APPLY[Dispatch complete message]
  START --> LINK{Link remains ready?}
  LINK -->|no| CLEAN[Clear GATT and reassembly state]
  CLEAN --> BACKOFF[Bounded reconnect/backoff]
  BACKOFF --> SCAN[Rescan after targeted retries]
  START --> VERSION{HELLO accepted?}
  VERSION -->|no / incompatible| STOP[Terminal version error]
  APPLY --> REBOOT{HUD reboot?}
  REBOOT -->|yes| ADVERTISE[Restart advertising]
  ADVERTISE --> RESYNC[Phone reconnects and requests snapshot]
  APPLY --> AUDIO{Audio/I2S init succeeds?}
  AUDIO -->|no| AUDIOFAIL[Current capture: I2S registration error; diagnose]
